Refactored `src/order.ts`: extracted shared helpers (`subtotalOf`, `tieredRate`/`loyaltyDiscount` for the duplicated discount functions, `calculateWeight`/`baseShippingCost`/`hasFreeShipping` for shipping, and `validateUser`/`validateItem`/`validateItems`/`validateCoupon` for validation, plus `tierDiscount`/`couponDiscountFor` for the total calc). This eliminates the near-duplicate `calculateMemberDiscount`/`calculateGoldDiscount` logic and flattens the deeply nested branches in `calculateShipping` and `validateOrder` into small single-purpose functions. All exported names/signatures are unchanged, and `node --test src/order.test.ts` passes (4/4).
